<template><section class="v2-page therapist-v2-page"><header class="v2-page-header"><p class="v2-context">工作台</p><h1>今天哪些患者值得关注？</h1><p>这里只出现需要专业处理的事项；正常训练不会变成逐条审核任务。</p></header><div v-if="loading" class="v2-state">正在整理关注事项…</div><div v-else-if="error" class="v2-state v2-state-error"><strong>工作台暂时无法加载</strong><span>{{ error }}</span><button class="v2-button secondary" @click="load">重新加载</button></div><template v-else-if="workbench"><section class="workbench-counts"><div><strong>{{ workbench.summary.open }}</strong><span>待处理</span></div><div><strong>{{ workbench.summary.acknowledged }}</strong><span>已接手</span></div><p>按触发时间排列，优先处理患者主动求助与持续性问题。</p></section><section><div class="v2-section-heading"><div><p class="v2-section-label">Attention Queue</p><h2>需要处理的事项</h2></div></div><div v-if="!workbench.attention_items.length" class="v2-state compact"><CheckCircle2 :size="32"/><strong>目前没有新的关注事项</strong><span>正常训练记录仍会保留在患者工作区。</span></div><div v-else class="attention-grid"><AttentionCard v-for="item in workbench.attention_items" :key="item.id" :item="item" @acknowledge="acknowledge"/></div></section></template></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">import { onMounted,ref } from 'vue';import { CheckCircle2 } from 'lucide-vue-next';import AttentionCard from '@/domain-ui/AttentionCard.vue';import { v2Api,type WorkbenchV2 } from '@/api/v2';import { toUserMessage } from '@/utils/errors';const workbench=ref<WorkbenchV2|null>(null);const loading=ref(true);const error=ref('');async function load(){loading.value=true;error.value='';try{workbench.value=await v2Api.workbench()}catch(err){error.value=toUserMessage(err,'请稍后再试。')}finally{loading.value=false}}async function acknowledge(id:string){error.value='';try{await v2Api.acknowledgeAttention(id);await load()}catch(err){error.value=toUserMessage(err,'暂时无法接手该事项。')}}onMounted(load);</script>
